(b) two Grants Officers, who shall be responsible for the day-to-day processing of applications and the monitoring of funded projects;

(c) one Accounts Officer, who shall be responsible for the financial records of the Division and for the preparation of the quarterly statements referred to in paragraph 8.2(d);

